    <div class="feature">
      <div class="ftext">
        <h2>Use it your way, wherever you are</h2>
        <p>Available in English, Persian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish, German, and French, with right-to-left support built in. Install it on your phone's home screen for one-tap access.</p>
