  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta">
  <div class="cta-in">
    <div class="eyebrow">Your homelab deserves better</div>
    <h2>Set it up in minutes. Check it every day.</h2>
    <a class="btn btn-accent" href="/docs/">Start building your dashboard</a>
